{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13487","headline":"丁评事宅秋夜宴集 · 柳中庸","name":"丁评事宅秋夜宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠幕卷回廊，银灯开後堂。\n风惊拥砌叶，月冷满庭霜。\n绮席人将醉，繁弦夜未央。\n共怜今促席，谁道客愁长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳中庸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}